Licensing status of the current source tree

No new project-wide public licence is granted by the standalone source cleanup.
Project-authored replacements remain subject to their authors' rights.

The bundled Eagle Dynamics SDK files and interfaces retain their existing terms.
Their inclusion does not relicense them as project-authored code.

Earlier revisions in the repository history contain IGServal's CustomFM
contributions and the historical F-16Demo-derived implementation. Those
revisions keep the licence files they were published with. This file does not
revoke permissions already granted for them.
